normalizes only the compiler subprocess locale so translated diagnostics cannot falsely fail a valid build.\n\nCloses #97\n\nThe final head is `5c45845ad15bd7995f20c81d7fd61501e5ca9d7e`. A catalog-independent regression checks locale isolation; focused German/French runs pass after the correction, either removed assertion and an unrelated compiler error still fail, and default plus5A3C runtime checks report1411 PASS. Product RTL and parameter policy remain unchanged.\n\n[Current validation and reproducible author evidence](https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/100#issuecomment-5773942386). All9 native commands and all six hosted jobs passed on the corrected head. [Full-bar receipts](https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/100#issuecomment-5774108311). R230-M1 remains open until the independent re-review; earlier full-bar results and reviews retain their original head attribution.\n\nExecutors: A161 initial guard implementation and A166 locale correction. Cleared-context reviewers: R229 internal Codex and R230 external Opus; corrected-head reviews are queued. Two positive reviews, clean coverage of all five lenses, current candidate validation and post-merge containment remain required.\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T06:49:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T10:07:39Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6439edc9e2a2fa06c4f9ce2e35d4ccaa273e321d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/100/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/100/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/p